
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LOANPEN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-DAYS   PIC 999.
       01 WS-RATE   PIC 99V99.
       01 WS-FEE    PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-TOTAL  PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 WS-FEE-O  PIC Z(6)9.99.
       01 WS-TOT-O  PIC Z(6)9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER INSTALLMENT AMOUNT:"
           ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY "ENTER DAYS LATE:"
           ACCEPT WS-DAYS
           IF WS-DAYS > 10
               MOVE 10 TO WS-RATE
           ELSE
               MOVE WS-DAYS TO WS-RATE
           END-IF
           COMPUTE WS-FEE =
               WS-AMOUNT * WS-RATE / 100
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-AMOUNT + WS-FEE
           MOVE WS-FEE TO WS-FEE-O
           MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-TOT-O
           DISPLAY "PENALTY: " WS-FEE-O
           DISPLAY "TOTAL PAYABLE: " WS-TOT-O
           STOP RUN.
